[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0620","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0620.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0835","title":"Sambar Server Search CGI 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.3 及 4.4 Beta 3 版本的 search.dll ISAPI Search 组件存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向查询参数中指定任意目录路径，利用 Search CGI 功能读取服务器上的敏感文件与目录列表。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的查询参数进行充分的路径过滤与校验，导致攻击者可越权访问受限目录。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，影响系统机密性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0835"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Sambar Server 至 5.0 及以上版本（该漏洞已在后续版本修复），或彻底移除/禁用 search.dll ISAPI 扩展。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 过滤规则，拦截对 /search.dll 的请求，或限制 query 参数仅允许合法字符（拒绝空字节 %00 和路径分隔符 /）。建议迁移至 Apache 或 Nginx 等现代受支持 Web 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0175.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1684","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0835","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2000/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0835.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0835.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0835.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0620.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0618","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0618.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0834","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet 客户端 NTLM 身份认证凭据泄露漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 telnet 客户端默认自动尝试 NTLM 身份认证，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 telnet:// URL 链接诱导目标用户访问，从而捕获并重放 NTLM 挑战/响应数据包，实现身份认证绕过。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。微软至今未发布官方补丁，建议禁用 telnet 客户端或限制 NTLM 自动认证行为。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0834"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33Z","remediation":"tags.\n\nLet me write the remediation based on the actual Microsoft security bulletin data I fetched.<value>立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-067 提供的官方补丁（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=0D0032E7-259D-4F68-BF08-B0A7CAA1FD1C），该补丁会在向非信任区域发送 NTLM 凭据前弹出警告提示。如无法安装补丁，可在 telnet 客户端中执行 `unset ntlm` 命令永久禁用 NTLM 默认认证，同时在边界防火墙/路由器上阻止入站远程登录服务（如 TCP 139/445/23/3389）以降低凭据重放风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a091400-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1683","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-067","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5242","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20222","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-0834.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2009/CVE-2009-1930.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2008/CVE-2008-4037.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0834.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0834.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-0834.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0834.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2008-4037/README_EN.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0834","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0834.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0618.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0616","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0616.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0833","title":"Jack De Winter WinSMTP 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Jack De Winter WinSMTP 1.06f 及 2.X 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 SMTP 服务发送超长的 USER 或 HELO 命令触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。由于 CVSS v2 评分为 10.0（攻击复杂度低、无需认证、完全机密性/完整性/可用性影响），该漏洞在特定条件下可能被利用实现远程代码执行。受影响版本包括 WinSMTP 1.06f 和 2.X 系列。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0833"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 WinSMTP 1.06f 及 2.x 版本中，该软件已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的 SMTP 服务器软件（如 hMailServer、MailEnable 等）。若无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 TCP 端口 25，并对 SMTP 命令长度进行限制：HELO/EHLO 命令不超过 64 字节，USER 命令不超过 128 字节，超出则直接断开连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/81693","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1680","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5255","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20221","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0833","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2000/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/84bee56eebc672b008a8b9d6058ddea66387743b/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0833.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0833.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0833.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0616.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0615","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0615.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0830","title":"Microsoft WebTV for Windows annclist.exe UDP报文拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft WebTV for Windows 系统中的 annclist.exe 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标主机的 22701 至 22705 端口发送特制的大尺寸畸形 UDP 数据包，导致 annclist.exe 进程崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响 WebTV for Windows 98/ME 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，但仅造成可用性影响。Exploit-DB 上已有公开的 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0830"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Microsoft WebTV for Windows，官方不再提供安全更新。建议在防火墙或主机层面阻止对 UDP 端口 22701-22705 的入站访问；如无需使用 WebTV 功能，建议直接卸载该组件以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/81852","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1671","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-074","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5216","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20219","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0830","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bb000df9f27fa146ab353b5455f4a8607b3ce719/2000/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0830.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0830.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0830.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0615.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0612","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0612.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0829","title":"Red Hat Linux Tmpwatch 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.1 中的 tmpwatch 工具在处理目录清理时存在拒绝服务漏洞。tmpwatch 会为每个目录层级 fork 一个新的子进程，本地攻击者可在 /tmp 或 /var/tmp 目录下创建深度嵌套的目录结构，导致系统因进程数激增而耗尽资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击条件简单，无需特殊权限即可触发，影响系统可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0829"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33Z","remediation":"升级 tmpwatch 至 2.5.2 及以上版本（Red Hat 官方已修复此问题）。如无法升级，避免使用 `--fuser` 或 `-s` 选项运行 tmpwatch，并在 cron 任务中限制 tmpwatch 扫描目录深度，同时监控 /tmp 和 /var/tmp 中是否存在过深目录结构（超过 500 层）以提前发现攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-080.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/81364","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1664","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5217","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20217","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0829","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bb000df9f27fa146ab353b5455f4a8607b3ce719/2000/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0829.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0829.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0829.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0612.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0607","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0607.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0828","title":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 的 ddicgi.exe 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长 User-Agent 参数触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，已有公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0828"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:33Z","remediation":"Mobius DocumentDirect for the Internet 1.2 已停止维护，官方未发布补丁。建议立即卸载该产品，或至少升级到不受影响的最新版本。如无法卸载，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层面添加规则，过滤 User-Agent 头中超过 256 字节的异常请求，并限制 ddicgi.exe 的执行权限为最低账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a090800-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1657","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5212","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0828","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8b136ad0f9c6a3aaf75bfb273a0e3f34c40c3fb/2000/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0828.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0828.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0828.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0607.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0607.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0607.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0604","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0824","title":"GNU glibc unsetenv 环境变量处理本地权限提升漏洞","description":"glibc 2.1.1 中的 unsetenv 函数存在环境变量处理缺陷，当同一环境变量被重复设置两次时，unsetenv 仅移除第一次出现的变量而保留第二次，导致 setuid 程序无法正确清除危险环境变量。本地攻击者可通过传入重复的 LD_PRELOAD 或 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 环境变量，在 setuid 程序中加载恶意共享库，从而以提升的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 glibc 2.1.1 的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地账户权限即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0824"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.1.2 及以上版本，该版本修复了 unsetenv 对重复环境变量处理不当的问题。如无法升级，可在系统层移除 setuid 程序中对 LD_PRELOAD/LD_LIBRARY_PATH 等危险环境变量的继承，或通过 pam_env 模块限制用户自定义环境变量传递。对于关键服务，建议使用 glibc 补丁包（如 RedHat 的 RHSA-2000:065）进行修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0436.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0509.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0525.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93760201002154&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-028.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000902","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/MDKSA-2000-040.php3","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/MDKSA-2000-045.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/adv5_draht_glibc_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-057.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/79537","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1639","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/648","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-September/000020.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5173","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0824","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71d64a6d3b3901a67b0e17d4598d8a385b75e78d/2000/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0824.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0824.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-redhat/blob/83f4a2ccebd09d57422c724140391aef39e9fafa/2000/CVE-2000-0824.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0604.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0989","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0989.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0877","title":"Mailform mailform 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"mailform CGI 脚本存在路径遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列（如 ../）的参数绕过路径限制，读取服务器上任意文件内容。该漏洞影响使用 mailform 处理表单提交的 Web 应用，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需向目标发送恶意构造的 HTTP 请求即可泄露敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd、配置文件、源代码等），导致信息泄露并可能进一步攻击服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0877"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-11-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"更新 MailForm 到最新版本（2.1或更高）并应用安全补丁包。禁用 mailform.pl 脚本或修改 XX-attach_file 参数验证规则，限制文件访问路径并实施权限检查。同时部署 WAF 规则过滤恶意参数访问，并定期审核系统文件权限配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0877","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fc3c209ab3b380e61580f037335fd28cb053661f/2000/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0877.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0877.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0877.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0989.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0989.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0989.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1075","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1075.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1080","title":"Id Software Quake 1.0/1.9 UDP Packet 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Id Software Quake 1.0/1.9 及 ProQuake 1.01 及更早版本存在 UDP 数据包处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的空 UDP 数据包，触发服务崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，仅影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1080"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"建议升级至 ProQuake 1.02 或更高版本（该版本已修复空 UDP 包处理逻辑）。对于原版 Quake 1，建议迁移至社区维护的现代源码移植版（如 QuakeSpasm、DarkPlaces），这些版本已修复此拒绝服务漏洞。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙或主机 iptables 层面添加规则，丢弃发往 Quake 服务端口（UDP 26000）的异常短包作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97318797630246&w=2","http://proquake.ai.mit.edu/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1900","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5527","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1080.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1080.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1080","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1080.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1080.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2000/CVE-2000-1080.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1080.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1080.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1080.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1080.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1075.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0853","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0853.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1219","title":"GNU GCC 编译器整数溢出漏洞","description":"GCC 和 G++ 编译器 3.3.3 及更早版本中的 -ftrapv 编译选项未能正确处理所有类型的整数溢出情况，导致使用该选项编译的应用程序在运行时仍可能因整数溢出而存在安全漏洞。攻击者可利用此缺陷触发未定义行为，导致程序崩溃或潜在的信息泄露、权限提升。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涉及所有使用受影响 GCC/G++ 版本编译的应用程序，攻击条件低，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1219"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:24Z","remediation":"建议将 gcc 和 g++ 升级至 3.4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 libgcc2.c 中 __mulvsi3、__mulvdi3、__subvsi3、__subvdi3 及 __absvdi2 等整数溢出检测例程的错误实现，使 -ftrapv 选项能正确拦截有符号整数溢出。如短期内无法升级，请勿依赖 -ftrapv 作为整数溢出防护手段，改用编译器警告（-Woverflow）及代码层面的显式边界检查进行缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://gcc.gnu.org/ml/gcc-bugs/2002-05/msg00198.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/540517","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1219.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1219.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1219","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1219.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1219.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1219.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2000/CVE-2000-1219.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1219.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2000/CVE-2000-1219.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1219.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0853.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1608","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0793","title":"诺顿 诺诺瑞客户端防毒自动保护失效漏洞","description":"Norton AntiVirus 5.00.01C 配合 Novell Netware 客户端时，在首个用户注销系统后未能正确重启自动防护服务，导致防毒保护失效。该漏洞影响运行该组合环境的系统，攻击者可在用户注销后利用防护空窗期植入恶意代码或执行任意操作，CVSS 评分 10.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属远程可利用的严重缺陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0793"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29Z","remediation":"建议升级 Norton AntiVirus 至 5.00.01D 或更高版本（Symantec 官方补丁修复了首次用户注销后自动防护服务无法重启的问题），或通过 Symantec LiveUpdate 安装 2000 年 10 月发布的安全更新。若暂时无法升级，可在 Novell Netware 客户端登出脚本中添加 `navapw32.exe /restart` 命令强制重启自动防护服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1533","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=398222C5%40zathras.cc.vt.edu","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0793","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/790c2d6c2f00f7f154de7420ee269c333853d9a4/2000/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0793.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0793.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0793.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1606","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0788","title":"Microsoft Word 邮件合并功能代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Word 的邮件合并（Mail Merge）功能在处理 Access 数据库时存在安全机制缺失漏洞。该功能在读取数据库中嵌入的 Visual Basic（VBA）脚本时，不会事先向用户弹出安全提示或请求确认，便直接执行脚本内容。攻击者可构造包含恶意 VBA 脚本的 Access 数据库文件，并诱导用户通过 Word 邮件合并功能打开，从而在用户环境中以当前用户权限执行任意命令，实现恶意代码植入、数据窃取或系统控制。该漏洞无需特殊认证条件即可触发，且攻击影响面较大，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。受影响组件为旧版 Microsoft Word 的邮件合并工具，建议用户避免打开来源不明的数据库文件，并升级至已修复该问题的安全版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0788"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"tags.\n\nThe vulnerability: Mail Merge tool in Microsoft Word executes VBA scripts in Access database without prompting. Corresponding to Microsoft advisory MS00-071 (the current TOML incorrectly says MS00-058, but the NVD references show ms00-071).\n\nLet me check the references: NVD references include https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-071 — so it's MS00-071, not MS00-058. The CVE-2002-0619 is a variant of MS00-071.\n\nSo the remediation should reference MS00-071. For Word 2000, the patch was for Word 2000. Let me write a proper remediation.\n\nNote: the requirement says output only the field value between <value> tags. The output must be Chinese, ≥20 chars, with actionable steps.\n\nLet me craft:\n\n建议立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-071 提供的补丁（Microsoft Word 2000），修复邮件合并功能打开 Access 数据库时自动执行 VBA 脚本的问题。如无法及时安装补丁，可采取以下缓解措施：一、在 Word 中将宏安全级别设置为\"高\"，并取消勾选\"信任对 VBA 工程对象模型的访问\"选项，使宏执行前强制提示或直接禁用；二、仅从可信来源获取邮件合并所需的 .mdb 数据库文件，不要打开来源不明的 Access 数据库，避免加载恶意 VBA 脚本；三、通过组策略或注册表禁用邮件合并自动运行宏，并保持 Office 安全更新为最新状态。同时开启附件和宏安全防护，限制从邮件或网页中打开此类文档。\n\nThat's good. Let me output it.<value>建议立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-071 提供的补丁（适用于 Microsoft Word 2000），修复邮件合并功能在打开 Access 数据库时未提示即自动执行 VBA 脚本的缺陷。如无法及时安装补丁，可采取以下缓解措施：一、在 Word 中将宏安全级别设置为\"高\"，并取消勾选\"信任对 VBA 工程对象模型的访问\"选项，使宏执行前强制弹出确认提示或直接禁用；二、设置邮件合并数据源时，仅从可信来源选择 .mdb 数据库文件，严禁打开来源不明的 Access 数据库，避免加载恶意 VBA 脚本；三、通过组策略或注册表策略限制邮件合并自动运行宏，同时警惕通过 Outlook、IE 或邮件附件诱导打开此类文档的投递方式，并保持安装最新版 Office 安全更新以彻底封堵该攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1566","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=398EB9CA.27E03A9C%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-071","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5322","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2002/CVE-2002-0619.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0788","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c0d14064d79c9a0ab84002492c5a6bf474f81cd3/2000/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0788.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0788.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0788.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1600","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0784","title":"Rapidstream VPN appliance 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Rapidstream 2.1 Beta VPN 设备中的 SSH 守护进程（sshd）存在硬编码的\"rsadmin\"管理员账户，该账户密码为空且无法修改。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接使用该账户通过 SSH 协议登录到目标设备，并在系统权限下执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响 Rapidstream VPN 设备的 2.1 Beta 版本，由于利用门槛极低且无需任何权限，攻击者可借此完全控制目标设备，从而进一步渗透内部网络。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0784"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"升级 Rapidstream VPN 设备至受厂商支持的正式稳定版本，删除或禁用硬编码的 rsadmin 账户，为所有 SSH 管理账户设置高强度密码并启用账户锁定策略，通过防火墙或 ACL 限制 SSH 仅允许可信管理网段访问。若设备已停止维护，建议迁移至现代受支持的 VPN 解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0216.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1574","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8c5cb8015669b7fea66cc41d203b97a12e61abfc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be04a74d8eb7583856274b2516ee1145cf8d4218/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0784","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d7fec49e4355e166a4b0625e0b5eb4d2c8efa124/2000/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/dcf23aed58c5cab14c2c44b30593196b46bb051f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/387709ab0226578f568bf79a76d7e3ca05d5c97a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0784.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0784.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0784.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1520","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0762","title":"Computer Associates eTrust Access Control 远程管理员欺骗漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0762是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0762"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25Z","remediation":"标签中。<value>立即安装 CA（现 Broadcom）针对 eTrust Access Control 发布的安全补丁，该补丁修复了默认加密密钥漏洞；开启安装选项中的强加密机制，并将系统默认密钥替换为高强度自定义密钥。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙层面限制对 eTrust 管理端口的网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.ca.com/techbases/eTrust/etrust_access_control-response.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1517","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1583","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=004601c003a1%24ba473260%24ddeaa2cd%40itradefair.net","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5076","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0762.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2